# ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————————
# ——— Stripe: Local sandbox webhook configuration

# Use   : Authenticates the API request that reads the current Subscription.
# Source: A Stripe sandbox restricted API key with Subscriptions read access.
# Path  : Stripe Dashboard > Developers > API keys > Create restricted key
# E.g.  : rk_test_...
STRIPE_API_KEY=

# Use   : Verifies that each forwarded webhook payload came from Stripe CLI.
# Source: The signing secret printed after `stripe listen` reports `Ready!`.
# Path  : Stripe CLI > `Your webhook signing secret is whsec_...`
# E.g.  : whsec_...
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SIGNING_SECRET=
